\newlabel{fig:yawcoupling}{{4}{11}{The GPS position--yaw covariance coupling problem. GPS corrections build off-diagonal $\mathbf {P}_{x\theta }$ terms that leak into yaw when VO or LiDAR updates are applied, causing sustained map-frame rotation at $\sim $3.56$^\circ $/s}{figure.4}{}}
